# Local-only overrides for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored)
# and fill in real values — never commit .dev.vars itself.
#
# Phase 0 needs nothing here: D1 and Workers AI both work locally via the
# bindings in wrangler.jsonc with no secrets. This file exists now so Phase 1
# (password auth) only needs new lines added here, not a new pattern learned.

# Phase 1: password gate for the single-user dashboard.
# DASHBOARD_PASSWORD=

# Phase 1: session cookie signing key. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# SESSION_SECRET=
